{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54594","headline":"兵要望江南 占虹霓第七（京本作「占虹第九」○十一首） 三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占虹霓第七（京本作「占虹第九」○十一首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虹霓现，城寨可攻之。\n虹（辛本、川本作「蛇」）直入来爲病疫，浅虹兵瘴（京本作「青虹兵战」）要须知，移寨避灾宜（京本作「危」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}